/P 166 0 R
/E (He is not a traditional number ten who needs every attack played through him. He is more effective receiving on the half-turn, driving into space or making runs beyond the opposition midfield. His movement allows him to contribute across central and advanced areas without being tied to one position.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
